# 00 — Project Governance

Always applicable.

- Respect root `AGENTS.md`. This repository is the canonical source of truth.
- Authoritative curriculum = CKSci Student Reader + Teacher Guide. Never override, rename, or alter in place.
- Grade 4 · 30-minute blocks · Friday policy (see `AGENTS.md`: catch-up/review/synthesis/quizzes/makeup/FLEX allowed, never first exposure to essential core content) · conservative-school content constraints.
- No invented chapter titles; no advanced required vocabulary (kinetic/potential/mechanical/radiant/compression-wave/inertia).
- No commit or push unless explicitly requested. No Git remote.
- Roles + branching: see `docs/agent-workflows/BRANCH_AND_WORKTREE_POLICY.md`.
- Reviewer agents do not silently modify artifacts under review.
